d}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ -2 & k & 0\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & k+4 & -10\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-5 \\\\ (k+4)y &=-10.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe system is inconsistent if it has no solutions. For the system to have no solutions, one of the equations above must be false.\n\nIf $k=-4,$ then the second equation is $0=-10,$ which is false, and the system will have no solution.\n\nTherefore, our system is inconsistent when $k=-4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["5bbf5c12-3409-5553-9dd1-d59b687d99b6"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "be3cc917-c1ca-51f1-b1a3-22d23039ef3b" :answer/id #uuid "be3cc917-c1ca-51f1-b1a3-22d23039ef3b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cf92e2a8-ab48-5340-bcba-2883848e6c01" :answer/id #uuid "cf92e2a8-ab48-5340-bcba-2883848e6c01" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=-6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "124ff963-b72f-5e65-b019-142dc4093408" :answer/id #uuid "124ff963-b72f-5e65-b019-142dc4093408" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "495a45f0-bf5a-5f2b-853f-98a9a40f50da" :answer/id #uuid "495a45f0-bf5a-5f2b-853f-98a9a40f50da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d1ed5e36-0fb0-57ce-baac-38fe4ee2f4d2" :answer/id #uuid "d1ed5e36-0fb0-57ce-baac-38fe4ee2f4d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=-3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ba282d53-b116-5cfa-b41a-8b04b5bb86c6" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba282d53-b116-5cfa-b41a-8b04b5bb86c6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["be3cc917-c1ca-51f1-b1a3-22d23039ef3b" "cf92e2a8-ab48-5340-bcba-2883848e6c01" "124ff963-b72f-5e65-b019-142dc4093408" "495a45f0-bf5a-5f2b-853f-98a9a40f50da" "d1ed5e36-0fb0-57ce-baac-38fe4ee2f4d2"] :answer-field/correct "be3cc917-c1ca-51f1-b1a3-22d23039ef3b" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "2d5b5966-d0b2-51ba-a7a1-c76ebe8e6658" :question/id #uuid "2d5b5966-d0b2-51ba-a7a1-c76ebe8e6658" :question/problem "Determine the value of $k$ for which the following system of linear equations is inconsistent:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y &=-5 \\\\ 2x+ky &=-8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 2 & k & -8\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 2 & k & -8\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & k-6 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y &=-5 \\\\ (k-6)y &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe system is inconsistent if it has no solutions. For the system to have no solutions, one of the equations above must be false.\n\nIf $k=6,$ then the second equation is $0=2,$ which is false, and the system will have no solution.\n\nTherefore, our system is inconsistent when $k=6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["ba282d53-b116-5cfa-b41a-8b04b5bb86c6"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "60a6d9bd-3eb0-5fbb-8b4c-3b367438cadc" :answer/id #uuid "60a6d9bd-3eb0-5fbb-8b4c-3b367438cadc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "58b63595-07c3-5725-80e1-8d68eb1d1eac" :answer/id #uuid "58b63595-07c3-5725-80e1-8d68eb1d1eac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=-6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "bea126fd-72a5-56d7-8f24-ee9beadcdf63" :answer/id #uuid "bea126fd-72a5-56d7-8f24-